cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or analysis, please cite it as below, and cite each underlying figure with its report year and PDF page."
title: "Zambia's public finances through the Auditor General's reports, 2021 to 2025"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible analysis of the Office of the Auditor General of Zambia's
  Reports on the Accounts of the Republic (financial years 2021-2025),
  covering budget execution and surplus, the value of audit findings, and
  ministry recurrence. All figures are transcribed from the source PDFs with
  page citations.
type: dataset
